drafts, segments, and schedules. You keep the last click. No dashboard tour required. Connect an agent Welcome sequence Tag added newsletter Send email Welcome, start here Wait 2 days If opened the welcome email Yes No Workflows Sequences that keep running Welcome, launch, follow-up. Publish once. Lumail handles enrolment, timing, and exits while you write the next one. Build a workflow send.ts import { Lumail } from &quot;lumail&quot; ; await lumail.emails.send( { to: &quot; [email&#160;protected] &quot; , from: &quot; [email&#160;protected] &quot; , subject: &quot; Your login code &quot; , content: &quot;# Your code \n\n {{code}} &quot; , }); ✓ queued · priority lane Transactional Replace Resend. Same domain. Receipts, login codes, and the newsletter leave through the domain you already warmed up. One dashboard. One bill. A priority lane so a campaign never delays an OTP. See transactional email “ Lumail made me like email. It turned email from a side thing into the main marketing channel for my Linkhub business. ” Yannis Founder, Linkhub “ I&#x27;m not a marketer, but email is powerful. Thanks to the Codex integration, Codex actually implements all the marketing for me. ” Nicolas Indie founder “ I was using MailerLite and sending emails was a constant stress. Now my agent reviews it, fixes it, and sends it for me. I&#x27;ve sent over 3 million emails with Lumail. ” Melvyn melvynx.com · 3M+ emails sent Pricing You pay for emails sent. Never for subscribers stored. Type how many emails you send a month. We pick the cheapest plan and the bill for that volume. Emails you send each month Type a number or drag the slider. 1K 5K 20K 40K 100K 400K 1M Best match Creator $20 /month for 40K emails Free $0 /month Everything working end to end, for nothing. Start free 3,000 emails/month included No overage. The send simply stops 2 team members 10 AI credits/month 3 sending domains 1 web domain Unlimited workflows Agent, API, CLI and SDK access Creator For this volume $20 /month For a list that pays for itself. Start with Creator 40,000 emails/month included Then $7 / 10,000 10 team members 100 AI conversations/month 10 sending domains 1 web domain Unlimited workflows Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription Pro $60 /month More volume, more seats, a lower rate per email. Start with Pro 100,000 emails/month included Then $5 / 10,000 25 team members 300 AI conversations/month 50 sending domains 3 web domains Unlimited workflows Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription Business $200 /month High volume, more seats, lower rate per email. Start with Business 400,000 emails/month included Then $4 / 10,000 100 team members 1,000 AI conversations/month 1,000 sending domains 5 web domains Unlimited workflows Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription Transactional and marketing email share the same quota. No card for the free plan. Questions about pricing Do you charge per subscriber? + No. There is no subscriber limit on any plan, and no line on your invoice for list size. Import 50,000 contacts on day one if you want. The price only moves when you send. So what will it actually cost me? + The first 3,000 emails each month are free, no card required. Creator is $20/month with 40,000 emails included. A 20,000-contact list emailed four times a month is 80,000 emails, costing $48. Use the calculator for your volume. How is this different from Mailchimp, Kit, or Beehiiv? + Some competitors now expose MCP too, so compare the real workflow instead of the AI label. Lumail&#x27;s full catalog has 139 organization-scoped tools across campaigns, workflows, subscribers, analytics, and transactional email, with a visual app, CLI, SDK, and API beside them. The billing model is the other difference: Lumail prices emails delivered and stores unlimited subscribers, so a dormant record does not raise your bill. Can Lumail send my app&#x27;s transactional emails too? + Yes, and that&#x27;s the point. Point your app at our SMTP relay (smtp.lumail.io:587, STARTTLS) or the API and your password resets, receipts, and OTPs ship from the same place as your newsletter. They travel in a separate instant lane, so a 50,000-recipient campaign can never make a login code wait. Do I need to be a developer to use Lumail? + No. Everything runs from the dashboard: a visual workflow builder, a filter builder for segments, and an AI-assisted editor. The API and SDK are there when you want them, not a prerequisite. Can my AI agent run my newsletter? + If you already work in Claude Code, Cursor, or another MCP client, add your API token and 139 organization-aware tools show up. Ask for a campaign, a segment, or last month&#x27;s numbers and the agent does it. Entirely optional. The dashboard does the same job. Full pricing → Everything included 22 things you get on every plan. Free included. No feature paywall. You pay for emails delivered. The product is the same on every plan. Pricing that doesn&#x27;t punish you Unlimited subscribers, no per-contact pricing Unlimited lists, tags and segments Unlimited campaigns and broadcasts No line on the invoice for list size Dormant contacts cost you nothing 3,000 emails a month free, no card The whole product, on day one Visual workflow builder with branches and goals A/B test any step of a sequence AI-assisted editor Variables and conditional blocks Plain-text and HTML from one draft Capture pages on your own domain Filter builder for segments Inbox preview before you send Agents and sending Your AI can draft, segment and send REST API, TypeScript SDK and CLI SMTP relay at smtp.lumail.io:587 Transactional email on a separate instant lane Guided SPF, DKIM and DMARC setup Activity log for every action Open, click and conversion analytics CSV import with no list-size fee Paid plans add: The “Sent with Lumail” badge switches off · Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription · More seats, more domains, more AI conversations Ask AI Don&#x27;t take our word for it. Pick the question you actually have. We hand it to the assistant you already trust. Is it right for me? How does it compare? What would it cost me? Can my AI run it? “ I run a newsletter and I&#x27;m considering Lumail (lumail.io) for it. Read their site and tell me honestly who Lumail is a good fit for, who it is a bad fit for, and what I should check before switching. ” Ask ChatGPT Ask Claude Copy the prompt Talk to a human Import your list. Send tonight. 3,000 emails a month on the free plan, no card. Create an account Compare with others Lumail Email for people who write, ship and sell. Campaigns, sequences and transactional, one domain. GitHub X (maker) English ▼ Product Pricing Email editor Migrate to Lumail Changelog Documentation Blog Customer stories Lumail for AI Free tools All tools Mail tester Spam tester SPF checker DKIM checker DMARC checker Email validator Subject line tester Domain health score Email signature generator Email list cleaner Email extractor Email ROI calculator Compare All comparisons
